  "id": "BIT-tomcat-2026-116830",
  "summary": "Apache Tomcat: HTTP/2 checks frame type before size leads to DoS",
  "details": "Missing release of resource after effective lifetime vulnerability in Apache Tomcat's HTTP/2 initial connection handling leads to DoS.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat: from 11.0.0 through 11.0.27, from 10.1.0 through 10.1.61, from 9.0.20 through 9.0.123.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 11.0.29, 10.1.62 or 9.0.124, which fix the issue.\nNote: Tomcat 11.0.28 was not released",
